# Copy to web/.env.local (or set as env vars on your hosting platform)
# BEFORE `npm run build` — Vite inlines VITE_-prefixed vars into the bundle.
#
# Only needed when the frontend is hosted SEPARATELY from the NightRag
# backend (e.g. UI on Vercel/Netlify, API on Render). Leave unset when the
# FastAPI server serves the built UI itself — relative /api paths then hit
# the same origin and everything just works.
#
# Must be a full origin, no trailing slash:
#   VITE_NIGHTRAG_API_URL=https://nightrag-api.onrender.com
#
# Prefer the runtime override if you may change backends without rebuilding:
# set window.__NIGHTRAG_API_URL__ in your host's HTML before the bundle loads.
